(4/3/3/3/4).\\\\n' +\\n  '- Frozen record: `143f1053c98766b77d9d9ce573a5c8e976980f900387159312c3238288d71710`.\\\\n' +\\n  '- Registry status stays `candidate_review_ready`; separate integrated lifecycle\\\\n' +\\n  '  authority, not a renamed status, permits scoped production.\\\\n' +\\n  '- Required operations: classify four components with behavioral reasons;\\\\n' +\\n  '  form TCK/TVK/TK; compute GCK/GVK/GTK at Q = 500 and 1,000 with units;\\\\n' +\\n  '  compare all three totals and explain all three average changes.\\\\n' +\\n  \\\"- Required source use: fill the supplied four-row classification table's\\\\n\\\" +\\n  '  eight blank classification/reason cells. No graph construction is required.\\\\n' +\\n  '- Required answer form: justified table, three functions, two average-cost\\\\n' +\\n  '  rows with units, and bounded total/average explanations.\\\\n' +\\n  '- Prior knowledge: A04 substitution and elementary division/unit checking,\\\\n' +\\n  '  retrieved in print. Formal cost classification and dimensions are new.\\\\n' +\\n  '- Boundary: one month, Q = 500–1,000, unchanged capacity. Do not extrapolate.\\\\n' +\\n  '\\\\n' +\\n  '## 4. Concepts and terminology\\\\n' +\\n  '\\\\n' +\\n  '| Concept | Student-facing meaning | Formula | Canonical term / avoid |\\\\n' +\\n  '|---|---|---|---|\\\\n' +\\n  \\\"| Constant cost | Total amount does not change with Q within stated period/capacity | TCK | constante kosten; not simply 'a bill paid monthly' |\\\\n\\\" +\\n  '| Variable cost | Total amount changes with Q under the chosen contract | TVK = vQ in this model | variabele kosten; not every changed contract price |\\\\n' +\\n  '| Total cost | Constant plus variable total for the same period | TK = TCK + TVK | totale kosten; not an average |\\\\n' +\\n  '| Average constant cost | Matching fixed total per product | GCK = TCK/Q | gemiddelde constante kosten; not another invoice |\\\\n' +\\n  '| Average variable cost | Matching variable total per product | GV