ce | Blocks / does not block |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| H-BOOK2-ROOT-PLAN | open | book_plan_repair: create/review this plan, exact commit/hash and immutable evidence | Book readiness/assembly; not211 or plan repair |\n| H-CHAPTER-23-PLAN | open | chapter_plan_repair: reviewed C23 plan and exact published evidence | C23 production and whole-book readiness; notC21 |\n| H-221-PRIOR | open | goal_owner_decision on exact reviewed221 PartA retrieval plan, including no-registry-normalization decision | approved_goal_use/production221; not unrelated paragraphs |\n| H-22-ELASTIC-CONTRAST | open | goal_owner_decision on exact reviewed221/222 instruction/practice contrasts | approved_goal_use/production221/222; notC21 |\n| H-213-OPC2 | open, out of project | Separate governed formal output-choice authority | formal_output_choice_teaching; not agreed213 target scope |\n\nApproved book_plan_repair passed on2026-09-05. This PASS permits writing/review,\nnot release or assembly. The broader grant does not self-approve unseen teaching\nplans. Current frozen221/222 targets already contain both elastic and inelastic\ncases and explicit priors; historical audit rationales are not current facts.\nResolve teaching evidence, not target content. If owner decision is pending,\nstop only affected action and continue safe unrelated work.\n\n## Student product and output manifest\n\nNine theory paragraphs each emit `<folder stem> – paragraaf`, ` – opgaven`,\n` – antwoorden` as .md/.html/.pdf. Three consolidations emit opgaven/antwoorden\nonly. Every paragraph has paired `_assets/<id>_{fig,we,ex}_N.svg/.png`, thin\n`build_pdf.py`, textbook plan, independent review, schema2 PartA quality-ref and\ntextbook handoff. Preserve existing PartB content and companion quality fields.\n\nThree chapter stems: `2.1 Kosten en opbrengsten`, `2.2 Elasticiteit`,\n`2.3 Surplus en welvaart`; each emits ` – hoofdstuk` and ` – antwoorden`\n.md/.html/.pdf plus `_assets` and `build_chapter.py`.\n\nBook stems:\n\n- `Boek 2 Kosten, opbrengsten, elasticiteit en surplus – boek`\n- `Boek 2 Kosten, opbrengsten, elasticiteit en surplus – antwoorden`\n\nEach emits .md/.html/.pdf with book `_assets`. Platform assembly manifest:\n`build-scripts/books/book-manifests/book-2.json`, preface book-2-voorwoord.md.\nThis machine assembly contract is separate from the pedagogical root plan.\nCount:9×3+3×2+3×2+2=41 PDFs, with reproducible source and self-contained HTML.\n\nStudent book order: cover/title and edition/use preface, contents, C21 student\nchapter, C22 student chapter, C23 student chapter, terminology/formula/reference\nback matter consistent with already taught scope. Chapter fronts include goals.\nThe complete theory source already embeds its exercises: never append the same\nopgaven again. Each mixed source appears once. Answers never enter student\nchapters/book; the separate answer book follows the identical chapter/task order\nwith complete calculations, reasoning, units and bonus criteria. No paper-only\nroute instruction sends the reader to a website for answers or support.\n\n## Quality floor, ownership and evidence\n\nRoot is accountable coordinator/sole integrator; each paragraph has a distinct\nbuilder in isolated claimed paired worktrees. Plans precede content and receive\nindependent review. Authors cannot provide independent acceptance/quality-ref.\nEconomic, teaching, Dutch language, student-experience and visual reviewers\njudge actual usable paper output, not file counts. Specialist findings are fixed\nand independently rechecked; structural lead rounds1/corrections/2 follow the\nsubstantial output package. No core-spec failure may become a carry flag.\n\nTheory has exact seven exercise stages, fully printed optional guided support,\nexample then compact non-heading recap then two-role Start, deliberate fading,\nindependent task and frozen target, substantive optional bonus and cumulative\nclosing retrieval. All goals/operations are taught and assessed, answer forms\nm