      "stdout": "# Textbook-to-companion handoff — 2.1.2 Opbrengsten, winst en break-even\n\n## 1. Identity and current internal acceptance\n\nDate: 2026-09-06. Accountable integrator: codex-root. Book 2, Chapter 2.1 Kosten\nen opbrengsten. Lesson folder:\n`Boek 2 - Kosten, opbrengsten, elasticiteit en surplus/2.1 Hoofdstuk Kosten en opbrengsten/2.1.2 Opbrengsten, winst en break-even`.\nBoth integration branches: `codex/book2-part-a-production-20260905`; no new PR.\nDecision: **ACCEPTED WITH FLAGS**, exact current internal Part A paragraph.\nNo required paragraph correction remains; chapter/book, Part B, observed student\noutcomes and final CI/integration are separate gates.\n\n- Current paragraph review `2.1.2-review.md`, raw/LF\n  79429b9f1750710baae46751a5792e4a02e7c177888a01f5ca3a15c4039a78f7;\n  paragraph_212_r7_independent_review, actual actor paragraph_213_r7_independent_review.\n- Distinct specialist paragraph_214_builder: published platform payload\n  fedd9f066b192ee536b2b7237e4e46579ad75f00, publication\n  42a15f8ddaaf43acc2873b150f0deff7236840fd; lessons\n  82576440780607b06d8acb646d6030811740728b adopted as\n  301ce23aab7582bc0723e9a2319c57d39fec9578. Full report:\n  `reports/sprints/BOOK2-TEXTBOOK-PRODUCTION-1-212-QC-CURRENT-result.md`, raw\n  978cbcf3209b9822216276c7e31d90b775a41fe1d88bf4ffdcf50967ad0bc8ad.\n- Current `2.1.2-quality-ref.yaml` after explicit root-only transition, raw/LF\n  73bd2a2447b38c9d95cbc3bd69b8037e0f46b7564655b4513009fd6707b7b07d.\n- Root pre-acceptance verification commit\n  14a62363855a4be3559288f1d962ac242c77c30d; full result and native evidence at\n  `reports/sprints/BOOK2-TEXTBOOK-PRODUCTION-1-212-root-qc-result.md` and\n  `reports/sprints/BOOK2-TEXTBOOK-PRODUCTION-1-212-root-qc-evidence/`.\n\nBoth actual `validate-paragraph.js --mode part-a` profiles student-web and\npublisher-print PASS. Approved paragraph_production/specialist_review\ncurrentness, durable twelve-target authority and active umbrella bundle PASS.\nRoot 25 tests and full r24/thin r25/direct print r26/native checker pass with 34\nnative files unchanged and 81 raw/decoded page matches. No source or pupil\nartifact changed during acceptance. Specialist teacher14/student12/visual10\njudgments and 76 personal views are attributed separately, not root views.\n\n## 2. Textbook source files and exact outputs\n\nPlatform authoring: `build-scripts/content/book-2/212/`; generator\n`build-scripts/content/book-2/b2_212.py`, raw\n59fd442ed1d9e6edb2277df3746fecc3bfc08451f3bbb037f5c3cd4ef3b14270.\nUnchanged shared print pipeline raw\n51680fdffab6a62265857e19bce16a8c29010b7e1787a9c73c32ed7dcc5306e5.\nLesson `build_pdf.py` is thin, raw\n8bf1fab19138c303f8f68209dc2a35d401726f9ec6f3acbe5f8e052b6524e216.\nEdit platform sources and regenerate; never independently patch generated\nMarkdown, HTML, PDFs or archives. Use Python314 with original inherited PATH.\n\nAll editions use stem `2.1.2 Opbrengsten, winst en break-even – `.\n\n| Edition | Pages | MD raw SHA256 | PDF raw SHA256 |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n|paragraaf|14|9350d60fadee3494124f7b0593bc1efcf00db5ea292d0a19fc3f10518e11d1f8|e94d42f66ab9966a3a024cfef061c2084fcc1e2a6ef9e61e50c699c9155ce7a2|\n|opgaven|7|df2cd3fe66af760b55b1f28a2f51ca9c7449b4f1704d5da278db064850eef002|94ebe5d35207f6c605ca294a9e5bdccfa8c1a10e6717955e21abb3606a60406a|\n|antwoorden|6|4ffcb70c96f2c0c178a06a6092ec6701c4323cc1ac697de4156bc7cf0d43b8b3|d55f1da66723cd6f932cbf0793ce79d8d4188d2d907244fd40cc6f6fbad5ac90|\n\n| Edition | Self-contained HTML raw SHA256 | Same-edition ZIP raw SHA256 |\n|---|---|---|\n|paragraaf|85eff0548ce75161a2935e2bb3d0bb470f30ec10e95996c670605574d89454b5|e9d639f9119da0b118b58e9541f7d86ad9244960368cdaacc2f439b9c543d86f|\n|opgaven|87c55209dd450e989476f2f9779feb88de9fac9bbc77a0805112a444ffb65a06|c72b108912247d2f190466f8bac4fdab54e001652097199d3939920739ae12e8|\n|antwoorden|be02782985485caca268df98af897104d78feec9737032cd14803c978a318a82|575fe9051596241c1bd0a29b5ca40bdd3ad4a357f6fd387508277362abe7a28e|\n\n