pretation and self-constructed labelled graph. Teaching\ngraphs do not replace independent graph construction. Preserve units/periods\nand all frozen question words/scoring.\n\n## 4. Concepts and terminology\n\n| Concept / canonical term | Meaning and formula | Avoid / boundary |\n|---|---|---|\n|Totale opbrengst TO|P×Q for one price and matching period|Not profit; total-euro vertical axis is not unit price|\n|Gemiddelde opbrengst GO|TO/Q=P for Q>0 and fixedP|No division by Q0|\n|Totale winst / verlies TW|TO−TK for the same period|Negative result is loss, not negative revenue|\n|Break-even|TO=TK and TW0|Not zero revenue; not positive profit|\n|Winstafstand|Signed vertical TO−TK at oneQ|Not area between curves or physical length without scale|\n|Hele aantallen|Check neighboring feasible integers around exact crossing|Do not round intermediate values or assume round-down|\n\nLeft/right profit statements are bounded by the stated model/range and its\nincreasing-profit condition; do not generalize to nonlinear functions. Neutral\nDutch help wording treats errors as repairable practice.\n\n## 5. Procedures and actual prerequisite limits\n\n| Procedure | Unit scope and canonical steps | Taught location |\n|---|---|---|\n|Retrieve totals/units|A08: choose matching quantities/period, substitute and check units|Accepted211 retrieval; Start1|\n|Form TO|A07 fixedP only: identify units, multiplyP×Q, state same period|Theater explanation, worked kayak and exercises|\n|Compute profit|A21: select matchingTO/TK, subtract, interpret sign|Theater stages, kayak and target|\n|Find break-even|Equate totals, solve exactly, verify and check adjacent feasible units|Worked kayak; guidedsoap/pots; independent minigolf|\n|Construct graph|Axes/units/scales, two points per line, labels, crossing/zones/same-Q gap|Staged theater, full kayak, fading3/4, independent6/target7|\n\nAccepted211 review a75755c7c2e6cdffb2defcbb5403814cf854d87bfae9a8172dd768aadb5b8023,\nQC c85c44a53d46af87ad61500b83b0fd72