      "stdout": "# Part A Textbook Plan: 2.1.3 Marginale kosten en marginale opbrengsten\n\nVersion: `BOOK2-TEXTBOOK-PRODUCTION-1-213-plan-v1`.\nDate: 2026-09-05. Builder: `paragraph_213_builder`.\nState: `DRAFT_READY_FOR_INDEPENDENT_PLAN_REVIEW`.\nParent sprint: `BOOK2-TEXTBOOK-PRODUCTION-1`; umbrella #229; exemplar #223.\n\nThis is planning only, not student material, an independent verdict, a quality-ref\nor `_paragraph-plan.md`. Root remains the accountable coordinator/integrator.\nProduction waits for independent acceptance of this exact plan, independently\naccepted renewed §2.1.2 teaching and handoff, and root's explicit release. Old\n§2.1.3 sources, assets, reviews and PDFs are unaccepted salvage, left untouched.\n\n## Book foundation check\n\nHuman semantic authority: paired platform\n`references/authored/book-outlines/book-2-outline.md`. Machine currentness,\nfrozen target pins and action-specific hold lifecycle are checked separately in\n`references/authored/book-outlines/book-2-outline.meta.json`.\n\nOwned pair: `C:/wt/book2-213-production-20260905/{4veco-platform,4veco-lessen}`;\nboth branch `agent/book2-213-production-20260905`; task\n`BOOK2-TEXTBOOK-PRODUCTION-1-213`; agent `paragraph_213_builder`.\nPlatform base `44f9f6a040d43c1d558a74a01c7bf0b49549c26b`; lesson base\n`654c5e4b0cc8f9c442a9e55657660891ed403e73`.\n\n### Authority, outline, chapter, and target pins\n\nText hashes use canonical UTF-8 LF. Record hashes use SHA-256 of\n`JSON.stringify(record)` in registry property order. The schema-5 outline\nsemantic hash excludes its separately validated lifecycle projection.\n\n| Required pin | Exact value/evidence |\n|---|---|\n| Active v6 path | `references/owned/course-blueprint-v6-three-year.md` |\n| Active v6 version | `v6-three-year umbrella` |\n| Active v6 SHA-256 | `72fb1bc8c7b4843ac5cf4c29acfb9d117b6118eeaa1cd5fe5229604dfe412e6e` |\n| Active detailed v5 path | `references/owned/course-blueprint-v5.md` |\n| Active detailed v5 version | `v5` |\n|