      "stdout": "# §2.1.1 R5 — internal root acceptance with flags\n\n2026-09-06. Accountable integrator codex-root; #229 umbrella, #223 exemplar.\nDecision: **ACCEPTED WITH FLAGS for current internal Part A paragraph production**.\nThis closes current211 paragraph/QC/root-handoff gates, not chapter/book output,\nPartB commissioning, measured timing/attainment, fullCI or future merge consent.\n\n## Actual reviewed subject and adoption\n\nRoot read the complete specialist plan,327-line report,185-line exact probes,\n231-line runner, scope/publication tail and canonical schema2 record, plus prior\nroot current R5 verification. Independent paragraph reviewer is\nparagraph_221_r8_independent_review; separate specialist is\nparagraph_211_r5_specialist_qc. Neither is substituted by root's own judgment.\n\nPublished specialist pair186a17e78b5da34fed405b9e7a1e98e41cd86907 /\n9a9d576dbe3e58e4cf3db6ffebfb2785e582c1e3 was checked by exact normal remote\nbranch lookup before adoption. Original platform payloadb745985a and scope\n032414ee adopted cleanly as3df53cfe and\na288bed1008880c7601a431ad15a5f976d652256; lesson9a9d576d adopted as\n1fb8ce8555983dcb24a6192cc0a6a85ecc8c1c14. Specialist index-only186a17e excluded.\nNo merge, conflict, source change or historical proof rewrite occurred.\n\nThe newly attributed specialist report is raw\n9163d65e963907870d0b0a2e7d8427ad90425f68b8afd854ca691c614ff6c355; its exact\nindependent-probes.json is5d8ea2bb601af72002653b9b4c2e33591482fd78abe4e00b41c6a24c67cbc7a6.\nIts teacher14/14, student12/12 and visual10/10 are bounded applicable-core\njudgments, supported by personal inspection of31 fresh full pages15/9/7,\nsix actual figures/six fresh grays,735 actual body-text nodes, complete native\nDOM/source comparison, all worked/context mathematics and four-goal17-point target.\nNo required current correction was waived.\n\n## Independent root verification\n\nThe new211-root-qc-adoption-r5.js passes346 actual bindings: all100 imported\nplatform